{"id":70,"name":"المعارج","transliteration":"Al-Ma'arij","translation_fr":"Les voies d'ascension","translation_en":"The Ascending Stairways","type":"meccan","total_verses":44,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"سَأَلَ سَآئِلُۢ بِعَذَابٖ وَاقِعٖ","translation_fr":"Un demandeur a réclamé un châtiment inéluctable","translation_en":"A supplicant asked for a punishment bound to happen","transliteration":"Saala sailun biAAathabin waqiAAin"},{"id":2,"text":"لِّلۡكَٰفِرِينَ لَيۡسَ لَهُۥ دَافِعٞ","translation_fr":"pour les mécréants, que nul ne pourrait repousser","translation_en":"To the disbelievers; of it there is no preventer","transliteration":"Lilkafireena laysa lahu dafiAAun"},{"id":3,"text":"مِّنَ ٱللَّهِ ذِي ٱلۡمَعَارِجِ","translation_fr":"et qui vient d'Allah, le Maître des voies d'ascension","translation_en":"[It is] from Allah, owner of the ways of ascent","transliteration":"Mina Allahi thee almaAAariji"},{"id":4,"text":"تَعۡرُجُ ٱلۡمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ وَٱلرُّوحُ إِلَيۡهِ فِي يَوۡمٖ كَانَ مِقۡدَارُهُۥ خَمۡسِينَ أَلۡفَ سَنَةٖ","translation_fr":"Les Anges ainsi que l'Esprit montent vers Lui en un jour dont la durée est de cinquante mille ans","translation_en":"The angels and the Spirit will ascend to Him during a Day the extent of which is fifty thousand years","transliteration":"TaAAruju almalaikatu waalrroohu ilayhi fee yawmin kana miqdaruhu khamseena alfa sanatin"},{"id":5,"text":"فَٱصۡبِرۡ صَبۡرٗا جَمِيلًا","translation_fr":"Supporte donc, d'une belle patience","translation_en":"So be patient with gracious patience","transliteration":"Faisbir sabran jameelan"},{"id":6,"text":"إِنَّهُمۡ يَرَوۡنَهُۥ بَعِيدٗا","translation_fr":"Ils le (le châtiment) voient bien loin","translation_en":"Indeed, they see it [as] distant","transliteration":"Innahum yarawnahu baAAeedan"},{"id":7,"text":"وَنَرَىٰهُ قَرِيبٗا","translation_fr":"alors que Nous le voyons bien proche","translation_en":"But We see it [as] near","transliteration":"Wanarahu qareeban"},{"id":8,"text":"يَوۡمَ تَكُونُ ٱلسَّمَآءُ كَٱلۡمُهۡلِ","translation_fr":"le jour où le ciel sera comme du métal en fusion","translation_en":"On the Day the sky will be like murky oil","transliteration":"Yawma takoonu alssamao kaalmuhli"},{"id":9,"text":"وَتَكُونُ ٱلۡجِبَالُ كَٱلۡعِهۡنِ","translation_fr":"et les montagnes comme de la laine","translation_en":"And the mountains will be like wool","transliteration":"Watakoonu aljibalu kaalAAihni"},{"id":10,"text":"وَلَا يَسۡـَٔلُ حَمِيمٌ حَمِيمٗا","translation_fr":"où nul ami dévoué ne s'enquerra d'un ami","translation_en":"And no friend will ask [anything of] a friend","transliteration":"Wala yasalu hameemun hameeman"},{"id":11,"text":"يُبَصَّرُونَهُمۡۚ يَوَدُّ ٱلۡمُجۡرِمُ لَوۡ يَفۡتَدِي مِنۡ عَذَابِ يَوۡمِئِذِۭ بِبَنِيهِ","translation_fr":"bien qu'ils se voient l'un l'autre. Le criminel aimerait pouvoir se racheter du châtiment de ce jour, en livrant ses enfants","translation_en":"They will be shown each other. The criminal will wish that he could be ransomed from the punishment of that Day by his children","transliteration":"Yubassaroonahum yawaddu almujrimu law yaftadee min AAathabi yawmiithin bibaneehi"},{"id":12,"text":"وَصَٰحِبَتِهِۦ وَأَخِيهِ","translation_fr":"sa compagne, son frère","translation_en":"And his wife and his brother","transliteration":"Wasahibatihi waakheehi"},{"id":13,"text":"وَفَصِيلَتِهِ ٱلَّتِي تُـٔۡوِيهِ","translation_fr":"même son clan qui lui donnait asile","translation_en":"And his nearest kindred who shelter him","transliteration":"Wafaseelatihi allatee tuweehi"},{"id":14,"text":"وَمَن فِي ٱلۡأَرۡضِ جَمِيعٗا ثُمَّ يُنجِيهِ","translation_fr":"et tout ce qui est sur la terre, tout, qui pourrait le sauver","translation_en":"And whoever is on earth entirely [so] then it could save him","transliteration":"Waman fee alardi jameeAAan thumma yunjeehi"},{"id":15,"text":"كَلَّآۖ إِنَّهَا لَظَىٰ","translation_fr":"Mais rien [ne le sauvera]. [L'Enfer] est un brasier","translation_en":"No! Indeed, it is the Flame [of Hell]","transliteration":"Kalla innaha latha"},{"id":16,"text":"نَزَّاعَةٗ لِّلشَّوَىٰ","translation_fr":"arrachant brutalement la peau du crâne","translation_en":"A remover of exteriors","transliteration":"NazzaAAatan lilshshawa"},{"id":17,"text":"تَدۡعُواْ مَنۡ أَدۡبَرَ وَتَوَلَّىٰ","translation_fr":"Il appellera celui qui tournait le dos et s'en allait","translation_en":"It invites he who turned his back [on truth] and went away [from obedience]","transliteration":"TadAAoo man adbara watawalla"},{"id":18,"text":"وَجَمَعَ فَأَوۡعَىٰٓ","translation_fr":"amassait et thésaurisait","translation_en":"And collected [wealth] and hoarded","transliteration":"WajamaAAa faawAAa"},{"id":19,"text":"۞إِنَّ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ خُلِقَ هَلُوعًا","translation_fr":"Oui, l'homme a été créé instable [très inquiet]","translation_en":"Indeed, mankind was created anxious","transliteration":"Inna alinsana khuliqa halooAAan"},{"id":20,"text":"إِذَا مَسَّهُ ٱلشَّرُّ جَزُوعٗا","translation_fr":"quand le malheur le touche, il est abattu","translation_en":"When evil touches him, impatient","transliteration":"Itha massahu alshsharru jazooAAan"},{"id":21,"text":"وَإِذَا مَسَّهُ ٱلۡخَيۡرُ مَنُوعًا","translation_fr":"et quand le bonheur le touche, il est grand refuseur","translation_en":"And when good touches him, withholding [of it]","transliteration":"Waitha massahu alkhayru manooAAan"},{"id":22,"text":"إِلَّا ٱلۡمُصَلِّينَ","translation_fr":"Sauf ceux qui pratiquent la Salât","translation_en":"Except the observers of prayer","transliteration":"Illa almusalleena"},{"id":23,"text":"ٱلَّذِينَ هُمۡ عَلَىٰ صَلَاتِهِمۡ دَآئِمُونَ","translation_fr":"qui sont assidus à leurs Salâts","translation_en":"Those who are constant in their prayer","transliteration":"Allatheena hum AAala salatihim daimoona"},{"id":24,"text":"وَٱلَّذِينَ فِيٓ أَمۡوَٰلِهِمۡ حَقّٞ مَّعۡلُومٞ","translation_fr":"et sur les biens desquels il y a un droit bien déterminé [la Zakât]","translation_en":"And those within whose wealth is a known right","transliteration":"Waallatheena fee amwalihim haqqun maAAloomun"},{"id":25,"text":"لِّلسَّآئِلِ وَٱلۡمَحۡرُومِ","translation_fr":"pour le mendiant et le déshérité","translation_en":"For the petitioner and the deprived","transliteration":"Lilssaili waalmahroomi"},{"id":26,"text":"وَٱلَّذِينَ يُصَدِّقُونَ بِيَوۡمِ ٱلدِّينِ","translation_fr":"et qui déclarent véridique le Jour de la Rétribution","translation_en":"And those who believe in the Day of Recompense","transliteration":"Waallatheena yusaddiqoona biyawmi alddeeni"},{"id":27,"text":"وَٱلَّذِينَ هُم مِّنۡ عَذَابِ رَبِّهِم مُّشۡفِقُونَ","translation_fr":"et ceux qui craignent le châtiment de leur Seigneur","translation_en":"And those who are fearful of the punishment of their Lord","transliteration":"Waallatheena hum min AAathabi rabbihim mushfiqoona"},{"id":28,"text":"إِنَّ عَذَابَ رَبِّهِمۡ غَيۡرُ مَأۡمُونٖ","translation_fr":"car vraiment, il n'y a nulle assurance contre le châtiment de leur Seigneur","translation_en":"Indeed, the punishment of their Lord is not that from which one is safe","transliteration":"Inna AAathaba rabbihim ghayru mamoonin"},{"id":29,"text":"وَٱلَّذِينَ هُمۡ لِفُرُوجِهِمۡ حَٰفِظُونَ","translation_fr":"et qui se maintiennent dans la chasteté","translation_en":"And those who guard their private parts","transliteration":"Waallatheena hum lifuroojihim hafithoona"},{"id":30,"text":"إِلَّا عَلَىٰٓ أَزۡوَٰجِهِمۡ أَوۡ مَا مَلَكَتۡ أَيۡمَٰنُهُمۡ فَإِنَّهُمۡ غَيۡرُ مَلُومِينَ","translation_fr":"et n'ont de rapports qu'avec leurs épouses ou les esclaves qu'ils possèdent car dans ce cas, ils ne sont pas blâmables","translation_en":"Except from their wives or those their right hands possess, for indeed, they are not to be blamed","transliteration":"Illa AAala azwajihim aw ma malakat aymanuhum fainnahum ghayru maloomeena"},{"id":31,"text":"فَمَنِ ٱبۡتَغَىٰ وَرَآءَ ذَٰلِكَ فَأُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلۡعَادُونَ","translation_fr":"mais ceux qui cherchent [leur plaisir] en dehors de cela, sont des transgresseurs","translation_en":"But whoever seeks beyond that, then they are the transgressors","transliteration":"Famani ibtagha waraa thalika faolaika humu alAAadoona"},{"id":32,"text":"وَٱلَّذِينَ هُمۡ لِأَمَٰنَٰتِهِمۡ وَعَهۡدِهِمۡ رَٰعُونَ","translation_fr":"et qui gardent les dépôts confiés à eux, et respectent leurs engagements scrupuleusement","translation_en":"And those who are to their trusts and promises attentive","transliteration":"Waallatheena hum liamanatihim waAAahdihim raAAoona"},{"id":33,"text":"وَٱلَّذِينَ هُم بِشَهَٰدَٰتِهِمۡ قَآئِمُونَ","translation_fr":"et qui témoignent de la stricte vérité","translation_en":"And those who are in their testimonies upright","transliteration":"Waallatheena hum bishahadatihim qaimoona"},{"id":34,"text":"وَٱلَّذِينَ هُمۡ عَلَىٰ صَلَاتِهِمۡ يُحَافِظُونَ","translation_fr":"et qui sont réguliers dans leur Salât","translation_en":"And those who [carefully] maintain their prayer","transliteration":"Waallatheena hum AAala salatihim yuhafithoona"},{"id":35,"text":"أُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ فِي جَنَّـٰتٖ مُّكۡرَمُونَ","translation_fr":"Ceux-là seront honorés dans des Jardins","translation_en":"They will be in gardens, honored","transliteration":"Olaika fee jannatin mukramoona"},{"id":36,"text":"فَمَالِ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُواْ قِبَلَكَ مُهۡطِعِينَ","translation_fr":"Qu'ont donc, ceux qui ont mécru, à courir vers toi, le cou tendu","translation_en":"So what is [the matter] with those who disbelieve, hastening [from] before you, [O Muhammad]","transliteration":"Famali allatheena kafaroo qibalaka muhtiAAeena"},{"id":37,"text":"عَنِ ٱلۡيَمِينِ وَعَنِ ٱلشِّمَالِ عِزِينَ","translation_fr":"de droite et de gauche, [venant] par bandes","translation_en":"[To sit] on [your] right and [your] left in separate groups","transliteration":"AAani alyameeni waAAani alshshimali AAizeena"},{"id":38,"text":"أَيَطۡمَعُ كُلُّ ٱمۡرِيٕٖ مِّنۡهُمۡ أَن يُدۡخَلَ جَنَّةَ نَعِيمٖ","translation_fr":"Chacun d'eux convoite-t-il qu'on le laisse entrer au Jardin des délices","translation_en":"Does every person among them aspire to enter a garden of pleasure","transliteration":"AyatmaAAu kullu imriin minhum an yudkhala jannata naAAeemin"},{"id":39,"text":"كَلَّآۖ إِنَّا خَلَقۡنَٰهُم مِّمَّا يَعۡلَمُونَ","translation_fr":"Mais non! Nous les avons créés de ce qu'ils savent","translation_en":"No! Indeed, We have created them from that which they know","transliteration":"Kalla inna khalaqnahum mimma yaAAlamoona"},{"id":40,"text":"فَلَآ أُقۡسِمُ بِرَبِّ ٱلۡمَشَٰرِقِ وَٱلۡمَغَٰرِبِ إِنَّا لَقَٰدِرُونَ","translation_fr":"Eh Non!... Je jure par le Seigneur des Levants et des Couchants que Nous sommes Capable","translation_en":"So I swear by the Lord of [all] risings and settings that indeed We are able","transliteration":"Fala oqsimu birabbi almashariqi waalmagharibi inna laqadiroona"},{"id":41,"text":"عَلَىٰٓ أَن نُّبَدِّلَ خَيۡرٗا مِّنۡهُمۡ وَمَا نَحۡنُ بِمَسۡبُوقِينَ","translation_fr":"de les remplacer par de meilleurs qu'eux, et nul ne peut nous en empêcher","translation_en":"To replace them with better than them; and We are not to be outdone","transliteration":"AAala an nubaddila khayran minhum wama nahnu bimasbooqeena"},{"id":42,"text":"فَذَرۡهُمۡ يَخُوضُواْ وَيَلۡعَبُواْ حَتَّىٰ يُلَٰقُواْ يَوۡمَهُمُ ٱلَّذِي يُوعَدُونَ","translation_fr":"Laisse-les donc s'enfoncer (dans leur mécréance) et se divertir jusqu'à ce qu'ils rencontrent leur jour dont on les menaçait","translation_en":"So leave them to converse vainly and amuse themselves until they meet their Day which they are promised","transliteration":"Fatharhum yakhoodoo wayalAAaboo hatta yulaqoo yawmahumu allathee yooAAadoona"},{"id":43,"text":"يَوۡمَ يَخۡرُجُونَ مِنَ ٱلۡأَجۡدَاثِ سِرَاعٗا كَأَنَّهُمۡ إِلَىٰ نُصُبٖ يُوفِضُونَ","translation_fr":"le jour où ils sortiront des tombes, rapides comme s'ils couraient vers des pierres dressées","translation_en":"The Day they will emerge from the graves rapidly as if they were, toward an erected idol, hastening","transliteration":"Yawma yakhrujoona mina alajdathi siraAAan kaannahum ila nusubin yoofidoona"},{"id":44,"text":"خَٰشِعَةً أَبۡصَٰرُهُمۡ تَرۡهَقُهُمۡ ذِلَّةٞۚ ذَٰلِكَ ٱلۡيَوۡمُ ٱلَّذِي كَانُواْ يُوعَدُونَ","translation_fr":"leurs yeux seront abaissés, l'avilissement les couvrira. C'est cela le jour dont on les menaçait","translation_en":"Their eyes humbled, humiliation will cover them. That is the Day which they had been promised","transliteration":"KhashiAAatan absaruhum tarhaquhum thillatun thalika alyawmu allathee kanoo yooAAadoona"}]}